    {
      "bbox": [
        498,
        450,
        1279,
        508
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Offices of Midtown Planning and Development, Apparel Industry Planning and Development and the Midtown Task Force have had broad common objectives to improve conditions in the vital Midtown area og the Borough of Manhattan; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2312,
          "min": -1.1106
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.0174,
          "min": -0.4192
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13635,
        "area_px": 46374,
        "density": 0.29402,
        "chars": 240,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        498,
        507,
        1280,
        563
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The concept of special development offices within the executive office of the Mayor has been successful in encouraging overall planning and implementation of numerous improvement projects within the areas of their jurisdiction; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2281,
          "min": -1.2117
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0037,
          "min": -0.1134
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12211,
        "area_px": 44859,
        "density": 0.27221,
        "chars": 240,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.65
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        498,
        563,
        1280,
        639
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Over these years, certain common procedures, techniques and expertise have evolved within the staff of the Office of Apparel Industry Planning and Development, Midtown Planning and Development and the Midtown Task Force which are applicable to nearly all improvement projects in Midtown Manhattan; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1768,
          "min": -0.6841
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 54,
          "mean": -0.0088,
          "min": -0.4613
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16340,
        "area_px": 60599,
        "density": 0.26964,
        "chars": 310,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.97
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        498,
        638,
        1280,
        695
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City's fiscal situation has made it urgent that commercial institutional and residential development be aided in every way possible to encourage the use of private initiative and private funds in a constructive partnership with government; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1891,
          "min": -0.9898
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0036
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12778,
        "area_px": 45646,
        "density": 0.27994,
        "chars": 256,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        499,
        695,
        1280,
        750
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Mayor has undertaken a multi-faceted improvement program in Midtown Manhattan involving physical improvements, municipal service delivery and law enforcement; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1895,
          "min": -0.6872
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.033
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9431,
        "area_px": 44016,
        "density": 0.21426,
        "chars": 175,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.56
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        500,
        750,
        1280,
        789
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, A single, unified Mayor's Midtown Action Office is best suited to coordinate the aforementioned improvement program for Midtown Manhattan.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2084,
          "min": -1.0248
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0042
        }
