      "category": "Text",
      "text": "There is established in the Executive Office of the Mayor, the Mayor's Midtown Action Office which shall be headed by a Director who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The Mayor's Midtown Action Office shall supersede the Offices of Apparel Industry Planning and Development, Midtown Planning and Development and the Midtown Task Force, and shall coordinate municipal services and planning and physical development strategies in the area of Manhattan from 59th Street on the north to 14th Street on the south.",
